  "scope": "The repair workflow end to end: an owner-approved quote that binds the published build and price, an author-first slot, a regression gate that refuses evidence rather than scoring it, independent verification carrying its own replays, and an execution decision that waits for that confirmation. No repository access is issued, nothing is re-executed, and no repair is merged or deployed",
