    "covered": [
      "a repair brief cannot be published without an approved quote",
      "a published repair brief must offer the price the owner approved",
      "the quoted operator holds the first slot of a repair brief",
      "a regression test that also passes on the original revision is refused, and the whole submission rolls back",
      "a repair that fixes a different failure than the defect records is refused",
      "a repair cannot change files the approved quote does not cover",
      "a delivered repair is recorded for builder review, not merged, and the gate state is 'passed'",
      "neither the author nor a discoverer of the defect can verify the repair",
      "a confirmation must exercise the failure the repair fixed",
      "a repair is payable only after an independent confirmation, and a verifier's acceptance must state its own amount",
      "over real HTTP: a builder reads the quote, the delivered patch and its independent confirmation, is refused a verifier's acceptance at the repair price, and accepting the author's work moves it to accepted",
