  "visualReview": "Repair view checked from the rendered desktop and mobile screenshots; no axe violations or document overflow",
  "ci": "configured; not run on GitHub",
  "limits": [
    "repository access is declared, not issued: Trialoom holds no repository credentials and grants none",
    "nothing is re-executed: the gate reads reported replays and does not run the test, apply the patch, or check the patch digest against the changed files",
    "verification is not its own service: no brief, no quote, no distinct qualification, and no price except partial acceptance",
    "a one-slot repair brief admits no verifier, so its repair can never become payable",
    "one quote, one delivery and its verifications per brief; a second attempt needs a second brief",
    "a refuted or inconclusive verification is recorded but sets no flag and opens no dispute, and nothing weighs refutations against confirmations",
    "resource accounting and the end-to-end seeded run are untouched; accepted amounts are owed and unpaid"
  ],
